    {
      "id": "1.5.5",
      "label": "1.5.5",
      "numbers": [
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "कोसलो नाम मुदितः स्फीतो जनपदो महान् |\nनिविष्टः सरयूतीरे प्रभूतधनधान्यवान्",
      "iast": "kosalo nāma muditaḥ sphīto janapado mahān |\nniviṣṭa sarayū tīre prabhūta dhana dhānyavān",
      "translation": "A great kingdom named Kosala, a joyous and a vast one well flourishing with monies and cereals, is snugly situated on the riverbanks of Sarayu.",
