    {
      "id": "1.5.10",
      "label": "1.5.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "कवाटतोरणवतीं सुविभक्तान्तरापणाम् |\nसर्वयन्त्रायुधवतीमुषितां सर्वशिल्पिभिः",
      "iast": "kapāṭa toraṇavartī su vibhak{}ta antarāpaṇām |\nsarva yantra ayudhavatīm uṣitām sarva śilpibhiḥ",
      "translation": "That city is surrounded with gateways and archways; the front yards of buildings are well laid; it is lodges all kinds of machinery, weaponry and craftsmen, and king Dasharatha dwells in such a city.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
