      "devanagari": "चित्रामष्टापदाकारां वरनारीगणैर्युताम् |\nसर्वरत्नसमाकीर्णां विमानगृहशोभिताम्",
      "iast": "citram aṣṭāpada ākārām vara nārī gaṇair yutām |\nsarva ratna samākīrṇām vimāna gṛha śobhitām",
      "translation": "Amazing is Ayodhya for its lay-out is like a game board called aSTapadi, and with its flocks of beautiful women moving thereabout, where all kinds of precious gems are heaped up, and where its seven storied buildings are picturesque.",
