      ],
      "devanagari": "गृहगाढामविच्छिद्रां समभूमौ निवेशिताम् |\nशालितण्डुलसम्पूर्णामिक्षुकाण्डरसोदकाम्",
      "iast": "gṛha gāḍhām avicchidrām sama bhūmau niveśitām |\nśāli taṇḍula sampūrṇām ikśu kāṇḍa rasaḥ udakām",
      "translation": "The housing is very dense and there is no place or ground unutilized, and all are constructed on well-levelled lands, and rice-grain is plentiful while the drinking water tastes like sugar cane juice.",
