      "label": "1.5.19",
      "numbers": [
        19
      ],
      "devanagari": "विमानमिव सिद्धानां तपसाधिगतं दिवि |\nसुनिवेशितवेश्मान्तां नरोत्तमसमावृताम्",
      "iast": "vimānam iva siddhānām tapasa adhigatam divi |\nsu niveśita veśmāntām narottama samāvṛtām",
      "translation": "Ayodhya is like a hovering space station attained by sages by their ascesis, and its edifices are well planned and it is teeming with best people.",
